# Mirror Gallery's "The 'legend rule' doesn't apply" is about the rule itself, not its controller's permanents (CR 704.5j):
# with Bot1's Gallery out, Bot2 casts two Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer on turn 2 and keeps both - Bot2 is never asked which to
# keep (the refusal "! Bot2.Choose" holds after the second resolves). Hall of Echoes' "doesn't apply to permanents you
# control" is the narrower kind; this one reaches every player.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mirror Gallery
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Mountain x16

